abstract: >-
  Version 1.3 of the public architectural definition of ASNS, an evidence-first
  physical-world data infrastructure for industrial AI. It defines author-created
  technical terms, public component responsibilities, verification boundaries,
  stable channel identity, explicit time semantics, objective acquisition state,
  source lineage, versioned computation, reviewed knowledge, and historical replay.
